Governance fees are not supposed to be part of the share reserves. When opening shorts, they are part of the shares reserves. The relevant flow of variables in openShort is as follows:
openShort(bondAmount)
// _calculateOpenShort
shareReservesDelta = HDM.calculateOpenShort(bondAmount) // YSM.calculateSharesOutGivenBondsIn on curve
shareReservesDelta -= totalCurveFee
traderDeposit = HDM.calculateShortProceeds(bondAmount, shareReservesDelta)
// _applyOpenShort
