When a NFT is sold, Beekeeper calls BearPouch.distribute to distribute the received funds to the configured recipients according to their share value. The calculation of the amount to be transferred to each recipient uses FixedPointMathLib.mulWadUp which rounds up the result to the nearest whole number. File: BearPouch.sol
```solidity
