Pupnik NFTs can be redeemed at any point in time after it has been minted. Redeeming a Pupnik whose ID is strictly less than amountMinted while the sale is ongoing will cause subsequent sales to revert, because the redemption decrements amountMinted, which the sale relies on. The decrement will attempt to mint the existing ID of amountMinted before it is decremented.
