Impact: A blacklisted user can transfer their tokens to a non-blacklisted user, effectively evading the blacklist.

AccountableFixedTerm::coverDefault allows InvestmentManager of the loan to add additional assets to the system.  

```solidity
function coverDefault(uint256 assets, address provider) external onlySafetyModuleOrManager
    whenNotPaused {
    _requireLoanInDefault();
    loanState = LoanState.InDefaultClaims;
    IAccountableVault(vault).lockAssets(assets, provider);
